<div style="text-align: center;">
<p><strong>SCP-CASH4D-J: &quot;The People Person&quot;</strong><br />
When standing on the shoulders of giants, it's best to not look down.</p>
<p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/this-page-intentionally-left-blank">More by this author!</a></strong></p>
